---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const breadcrumbJsonLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
  itemListElement: [
    {
      '@type': 'ListItem',
      position: 1,
      name: 'Home',
      item: 'https://strovagroups.in/',
    },
    {
      '@type': 'ListItem',
      position: 2,
      name: 'Privacy Policy',
      item: 'https://strovagroups.in/privacy/',
    },
  ],
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Strova Group"
  description="Strova Group's Privacy Policy outlining data protection practices under India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act (DPDP Act 2023)."
  jsonLd={[breadcrumbJsonLd]}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <span class="section-eyebrow">Privacy &amp; Data Governance</span>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted">Last updated: October 12, 2026</p>

      <div class="card card--quiet" style="padding: var(--space-6); margin-block: var(--space-6); border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);">
        <p class="text-xs text-muted" style="margin: 0;">
          <strong>Data Fiduciary Notice:</strong> Strova Group is a proprietorship of Babita Kumari (MSME Registration: UDYAM-JH-20-0147452). This privacy policy outlines data governance across our marketing website (<a href="https://strovagroups.in">strovagroups.in</a>) and invite-only client portal (<a href="https://portal.strovagroups.in">portal.strovagroups.in</a>).
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2>1. Data Fiduciary Identity &amp; Principles</h2>
      <p>
        Under the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 ("DPDP Act") of India, <strong>Strova Group</strong> acts as a Data Fiduciary. We adhere strictly to purpose limitation, data minimization, and transparent processing. We do not sell, rent, monetize, or disclose your personal data to data brokers or advertising exchanges.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Personal Data We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        We restrict collection to operational necessities for quotation evaluation and project execution:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Quote Requests:</strong> Name, work email address, project requirements, and optional fields (company name, phone/WhatsApp number, rough project timeline).</li>
        <li><strong>Client Portal (portal.strovagroups.in):</strong> Client email address for 6-digit one-time passcode (OTP) authentication, project milestone events, order messaging exchanges, and deliverable file access logs.</li>
        <li><strong>Communications:</strong> Direct email correspondence sent to <a href="mailto:info@strovagroups.in">info@strovagroups.in</a> or messages initiated via our official WhatsApp business channel (<a href="https://wa.me/919288077802">+91 92880 77802</a>).</li>
        <li><strong>Technical Edge Logs:</strong> Standard request metadata (anonymized IP, user-agent, timestamp) collected by Cloudflare edge servers solely for bot mitigation and DDoS prevention.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Lawful Purpose of Processing</h2>
      <p>
        Data is processed strictly for legitimate uses under Section 7 of the DPDP Act 2023:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Evaluating inbound project specifications and returning written fixed-scope proposals within 1 business day.</li>
        <li>Delivering contractual milestones, staging previews, and repository handover.</li>
        <li>Operating the secure client portal for order tracking, messaging, and file delivery.</li>
        <li>Fulfilling legal, accounting, and tax compliance obligations in India.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Cookies &amp; Tracking Architecture</h2>
      <p>
        Our public marketing site sets <strong>zero tracking or third-party advertising cookies</strong>. We use cookieless, privacy-preserving event analytics that do not track users across domains.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our authenticated client portal utilizes only strictly necessary, encrypted session cookies (<code>HttpOnly</code>, <code>Secure</code>, <code>SameSite=Lax</code>) required for session persistence.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Data Retention &amp; Erasure Schedule</h2>
      <p>
        Inquiries that do not materialize into active client contracts are retained for up to twelve (12) months before being securely purged, unless earlier erasure is requested.
      </p>
      <p>
        Active client project records and invoices are retained for seven (7) years to satisfy statutory tax and commercial record-keeping regulations under Indian law.
      </p>

      <h2 id="privacy-choices">6. Data Principal Rights &amp; Privacy Choices</h2>
      <p>
        Under the DPDP Act 2023, you have the following rights:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Right to Access:</strong> Request a summary of personal data held about you and how it has been processed.</li>
        <li><strong>Right to Correction &amp; Erasure:</strong> Request the correction of inaccurate data or complete erasure of non-statutory records.</li>
        <li><strong>Right of Grievance Redressal:</strong> Submit any inquiry or concern regarding data governance to our designated Grievance Officer.</li>
        <li><strong>Right to Nominate:</strong> Nominate an individual to exercise data rights in the event of death or incapacity.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>7. Grievance Redressal Desk</h2>
      <p>
        To submit a data access, correction, or deletion request, contact our grievance desk:
      </p>
      <div class="card card--quiet" style="padding: var(--space-6);">
        <p><strong>Entity:</strong> Strova Group (Proprietorship of Babita Kumari)</p>
        <p><strong>Designation:</strong> Data Protection &amp; Grievance Officer</p>
        <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:info@strovagroups.in?subject=DPDP%20Data%20Request">info@strovagroups.in</a></p>
        <p><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:+919288077802">+91 92880 77802</a></p>
        <p><strong>Response Timeline:</strong> Formal statutory acknowledgment within 48 hours; resolution within 30 calendar days.</p>
      </div>

      <p class="text-sm text-muted" style="margin-top: var(--space-8);">
        Strova Group is a proprietorship of Babita Kumari. Registered MSME: UDYAM-JH-20-0147452.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
